%% MUPP-007 Warning when removing claimed gifts
flowchart TD
    A[Parent presses Ta bort on an item in the admin list] --> B{Item claimed?}
    B -- no, or unlimited --> C[Usual dialog - R3]
    B -- yes --> D[Dialog says who claimed it and when, plus the usual text - R1]
    C --> E{Avbryt, Esc or Ta bort?}
    D --> E
    E -- Avbryt or Esc --> F[Item and claim stay - R2]
    E -- Ta bort --> G[Item removed as before - R2]
